default qlen 1000
    link/ether 52:55:00:d1:55:01 brd ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff


I have kept the repository at,
https://github.com/ra7narajm/virtio-mac80211

So if possible, do go through and let me know any mistakes.

Thank You.

-
Ratnaraj

